| `import layers` | Imports flow up one configured layer order, so shared code never depends on the code that uses it; `tests/integration/test_import_layers_gate.py` fails an import into a higher layer, a file no layer holds and a layer entry that places no file. | `make test` | [`import_layers.order`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | It cannot see an import made through `importlib`, `__import__` or a `sys.path` entry no search root names. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
